I got it. Here is the example code:

model1 <- '

f1 =~ x1 + x2 + x3

x1 ~~ var1*x1

x2 ~~ var2*x2

x3 ~~ var3*x3

var1 > 0

var1 < 1

var2 > 0

var2 < 0.5

var3 > 0

var3 < 1.5

'

fit <- cfa(model1, HolzingerSwineford1939)

