Hi,

I am also interested in how to perform CV with an SEM model. Couple questions: 1. How to get lavaan to fit the model, not treating the parameters solely as starting values? 2. With fixing the parameters for a new sample, won't that also change the effect degrees of freedom, ultimately influencing the fit statistics? How would one compensate for the fit?

Thanks,
Ross

